Chp6GetPlapped:
CheckLevel(0xB)
SVAL s7 9
BGT 0 sC s7
ENUF 0x16
GOTO 67

LABEL 0
CAM1 [2,14]
//WarpOut [0x1]
_WARP 0x0 0x1 [2,14]
Text(Chp6YOURCOOKED)
LOAD1 0 Chp6DeathBall
LABEL 67
NoFade
ENDA

Chp6Cave3:
CHECK_ALIVE 0x45
SVAL s7 0
BEQ 1 sC s7
CAM1 [25,5]
SoundEffect(0x2F0)
